# Design tokens

Use CSS variables from `src/styles/tokens.css` only.

- Paper background (`--bg-paper`), ink (`--ink`), accent ink-blue (`--accent`).
- Serif for zen quotes; sans for UI; mono for tickets, diffs, CI logs, code.
- No purple gradients, no neon glow, no dark-terminal default theme.
- Opening: brand-level **SDLC Koans**, one zen, one CTA — no marketing clutter.
- One job per section; motion only for reveal hierarchy (`fade-up` / unlock).
